step Hermit Ortell
  tip Hermit Ortell hides in the hills of eastern Silithus. He also decodes Encrypted Twilight Texts for a chance at a scroll of beckoning, but Bor Wildmane pays the reputation: keep the texts for Bor.
  turnin 8285
  accept 8279

step The three Twilight Keepers
  tip Each Keeper is a level 60, not elite, alone at a camp edge, and always drops its chapter: Mayna in the far west camp, Havunth in the camp south-west of the Hold, Exeter in the far south-west camp beside the Twilight Lord.
  collect 20394 quest 8279.1          -- Twilight Keeper Mayna
  collect 20395 quest 8279.2          -- Twilight Keeper Havunth
  collect 20396 quest 8279.3          -- Twilight Keeper Exeter

step Back to Ortell
  turnin 8279
  accept 8287

step Bronzebeard's Encampment
  tip The dwarves' camp in the south of Silithus. Talk Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper through their whole stories for Dearest Natalia. Noggle's Satchel lies on the mountain south-east of the camp. Deathclasp lives up the trail east of the camp: an elite, and his Knock Away can throw you off the cliff.
  complete 8304 @41.0,88.7            -- Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper
  collect 20379 quest 8282.1          -- Noggle's Satchel
  collect 20385 quest 8283.1 optional @45.1,92.3 -- Deathclasp's Pincer, elite: group of 2 or 3

