step Rubbings and brains
  tip Rutgar and Frankal hand out the next two quests at their camp. Each hive has a Glyphed Crystal to rub with the Geologist's Transcription Kit, and its silithid drop the brains: Hive'Ashi north of the Hold, Hive'Zora in the west, Hive'Regal in the south. Inside Hive'Regal waits Mistress Natalia (level 62 elite, mind control and fear; group of 3 to 5). Now and then a hive silithid drops Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter: it starts a quest for Rutgar worth 100.
  accept 8309                         -- Rutgar Glyphshaper
  accept 8310                         -- Frankal Stonebridge
  collect 20455 quest 8309.1          -- Hive'Ashi Rubbing
  collect 20454 quest 8309.2          -- Hive'Zora Rubbing
  collect 20456 quest 8309.3 @52.0,99.0 -- Hive'Regal Rubbing, deep in Hive'Regal
  collect 20457 quest 8310.1          -- Hive'Ashi Silithid Brain
  collect 20458 quest 8310.2          -- Hive'Zora Silithid Brain
  collect 20459 quest 8310.3          -- Hive'Regal Silithid Brain
  accept 8308 optional item 20461     -- Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter, a rare drop

step Mistress Natalia
  zone map 1414
  tip Optional: Natalia waits deep in Hive'Regal, the hive in the south of Silithus. She is a level 62 elite who mind-controls, fears and heals herself below half health: bring a group of 3 to 5 and interrupt her heals.
